      ],
      "source": "https://wvexplorer.com/helvetia-west-virginia-swiss/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Helvetia keeps Swiss traditions alive, hosting an annual Fasnacht celebration that blends Swiss Fasnacht and Sechseläuten customs.",
